2026-09-24T15:53:17.7784625Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T15:53:17.7784980Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T15:53:17.7785322Z   ccache: |
